  "content_updated_at": "2026-07-20T08:21:46.000Z",
  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"cOux5\" id=\"cOux5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0157ac8\" id=\"ua0157ac8\">Spark 执行与任务生命周期管理</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"qvNXy\" id=\"qvNXy\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5ac4efd\" id=\"uc5ac4efd\">1. 要解决的问题</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u253b2792\" id=\"u253b2792\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0e8dbe73\" id=\"u0e8dbe73\">Spark Job 是跨进程、长耗时、有外部 application id 的任务。一次 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u41301dce\" id=\"u41301dce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98dde350\" id=\"u98dde350\">spark-submit</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uadf514a8\" id=\"uadf514a8\"> 调用不能解决状态持久化、失败重试、服务重启恢复、取消和审计问题。本项目先建立统一 Job 领域模型，再把提交器和存储实现放到端口后面。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"oFvbO\" id=\"oFvbO\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03bd660f\" id=\"u03bd660f\">2. 领域模型与端口</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"XGjap\" id=\"XGjap\"><code data-lake-id=\"u64b32906\" id=\"u64b32906\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9a07d4d\" id=\"ud9a07d4d\">JobRecord</span></code></h3><table data-lake-id=\"FsHFT\" id=\"FsHFT\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"375\"><col width=\"375\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u98b02634\" id=\"u98b02634\"><td data-lake-id=\"ue58eda67\" id=\"ue58eda67\"><p data-lake-id=\"u3460a8e0\" id=\"u3460a8e0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8430daf\" id=\"ud8430daf\">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u73dac17b\" id=\"u73dac17b\"><p data-lake-id=\"u41855f3a\" id=\"u41855f3a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f755458\" id=\"u6f755458\">作用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u76435089\" id=\"u76435089\"><td data-lake-id=\"u7a618423\" id=\"u7a618423\"><p data-lake-id=\"u412b5e22\" id=\"u412b5e22\"><code data-lake-id=\"u1111951d\" id=\"u1111951d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63dbf69c\" id=\"u63dbf69c\">run_id</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ub35f35d1\" id=\"ub35f35d1\"><p data-lake-id=\"u593978d9\" id=\"u593978d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b2d9ce4\" id=\"u3b2d9ce4\">关联一次 Agent 运行</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"uc4ca60f5\" id=\"uc4ca60f5\"><td data-lake-id=\"u14c54ecd\" id=\"u14c54ecd\"><p data-lake-id=\"u53fb89a3\" id=\"u53fb89a3\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue04c2a01\" id=\"ue04c2a01\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4b1e615\" id=\"ud4b1e615\">job_id</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u0f5e8e1b\" id=\"u0f5e8e1b\"><p data-lake-id=\"u41d9bb66\" id=\"u41d9bb66\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d2d6ab9\" id=\"u4d2d6ab9\">系统内部 Job 主键</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u48cd1343\" id=\"u48cd1343\"><td data-lake-id=\"u52254079\" id=\"u52254079\"><p data-lake-id=\"u2e888569\" id=\"u2e888569\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub23c2942\" id=\"ub23c2942\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2c8b01c3\" id=\"u2c8b01c3\">job_type</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ucd399fc5\" id=\"ucd399fc5\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5871e72a\" id=\"u5871e72a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud984eeeb\" id=\"ud984eeeb\">distributed query、pipeline、graph 或 vector</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u4781e7e6\" id=\"u4781e7e6\"><td data-lake-id=\"ucedccff2\" id=\"ucedccff2\"><p data-lake-id=\"u9e00af13\" id=\"u9e00af13\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7a9267c8\" id=\"u7a9267c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b7dc99f\" id=\"u3b7dc99f\">status</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ub3523ac8\" id=\"ub3523ac8\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8b99c294\" id=\"u8b99c294\"><span data-lake-id=\"u807825cf\" id=\"u807825cf\">当前领域状态</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u3984cca5\" id=\"u3984cca5\"><td data-lake-id=\"u68a933b4\" id=\"u68a933b4\"><p data-lake-id=\"u84455760\" id=\"u84455760\"><code data-lake-id=\"u119b59ae\" id=\"u119b59ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue72f8dd2\" id=\"ue72f8dd2\">payload</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc272995a\" id=\"uc272995a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u77476b49\" id=\"u77476b49\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue9da3309\" id=\"ue9da3309\">提交参数、SQL、数据集和 Spark 配置</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ucd5d8f5d\" id=\"ucd5d8f5d\"><td data-lake-id=\"u02dc5f95\" id=\"u02dc5f95\"><p data-lake-id=\"u12fb84d9\" id=\"u12fb84d9\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2cbf6dce\" id=\"u2cbf6dce\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub68b32d6\" id=\"ub68b32d6\">attempts</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u2791f2f3\" id=\"u2791f2f3\"><p data-lake-id=\"uf7af24ff\" id=\"uf7af24ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u22adef7f\" id=\"u22adef7f\">每次提交尝试的历史</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ub51605bb\" id=\"ub51605bb\"><td data-lake-id=\"u9cbc4b9e\" id=\"u9cbc4b9e\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8a8d1508\" id=\"u8a8d1508\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4a2d7108\" id=\"u4a2d7108\"><span data-lake-id=\"u055c6c5b\" id=\"u055c6c5b\">artifacts</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u26be0746\" id=\"u26be0746\"><p data-lake-id=\"u13cf36f0\" id=\"u13cf36f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f12d41d\" id=\"u7f12d41d\">与 Job 相关的产物路径</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 data-lake-id=\"vQjmA\" id=\"vQjmA\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc867620a\" id=\"uc867620a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d5fe4d9\" id=\"u4d5fe4d9\">JobAttempt</span></code></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u41a3c8b5\" id=\"u41a3c8b5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55e2c898\" id=\"u55e2c898\">每次尝试保存 attempt 序号、状态、外部 ID、错误信息和 metrics。重试不会覆盖首次失败证据。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"uSGVi\" id=\"uSGVi\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2f3589d\" id=\"ub2f3589d\">两个端口</span></h3><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22classDiagram%5Cn%20%20%20%20class%20JobStorePort%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%3CProtocol%3E%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2Bsave(record)%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2Bget(job_id)%20JobRecord%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20class%20JobSubmitterPort%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%3CProtocol%3E%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2Bsubmit(record)%20JobAttempt%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20class%20JobOrchestrator%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-store%20JobStorePort%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-submitter%20JobSubmitterPort%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-max_retries%20int%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2Bsubmit(run_id%2C%20job_type%2C%20payload)%20JobRecord%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2Bget(job_id)%20JobRecord%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20class%20SQLiteJobStore%5Cn%20%20%20%20class%20LocalJobSubmitter%5Cn%20%20%20%20class%20LivySubmitter%5Cn%20%20%20%20JobOrchestrator%20--%3E%20JobStorePort%5Cn%20%20%20%20JobOrchestrator%20--%3E%20JobSubmitterPort%5Cn%20%20%20%20SQLiteJobStore%20..%7C%3E%20JobStorePort%5Cn%20%20%20%20LocalJobSubmitter%20..%7C%3E%20JobSubmitterPort%5Cn%20%20%20%20LivySubmitter%20..%7C%3E%20JobSubmitterPort%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2Fea9a07a3a0bd3f8fae83e55d1096cbb8.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22l3Scv%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uda0d3ba5\" id=\"uda0d3ba5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a576e6a\" id=\"u5a576e6a\">Python Protocol 在运行时不强制继承，图中的实现关系表达结构化契约，而不是显式基类继承。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"YrzTi\" id=\"YrzTi\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue24e1b71\" id=\"ue24e1b71\">3. 状态模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u222ac528\" id=\"u222ac528\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9fb18008\" id=\"u9fb18008\">领域枚举定义了 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9be76ebf\" id=\"u9be76ebf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3552782\" id=\"uf3552782\">created</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udbbaf180\" id=\"udbbaf180\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u480b0385\" id=\"u480b0385\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e124d62\" id=\"u2e124d62\">queued</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u67c46d3d\" id=\"u67c46d3d\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u12e8ee5b\" id=\"u12e8ee5b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8abfcea1\" id=\"u8abfcea1\">submitted</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u96f71963\" id=\"u96f71963\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2486e1d7\" id=\"u2486e1d7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud2ceea77\" id=\"ud2ceea77\">running</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u854d420d\" id=\"u854d420d\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub3ce115f\" id=\"ub3ce115f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u080110c0\" id=\"u080110c0\">succeeded</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7d8b3af5\" id=\"u7d8b3af5\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud70bdcf7\" id=\"ud70bdcf7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e452fba\" id=\"u5e452fba\">failed</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u32e4622d\" id=\"u32e4622d\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua2906d03\" id=\"ua2906d03\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78d00e64\" id=\"u78d00e64\">retrying</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2412caab\" id=\"u2412caab\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufe90f7d1\" id=\"ufe90f7d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21a18c64\" id=\"u21a18c64\">cancelled</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8250f8e3\" id=\"u8250f8e3\">。当前 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udc5e2001\" id=\"udc5e2001\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf886620\" id=\"ucf886620\">JobOrchestrator</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7b44e908\" id=\"u7b44e908\"> 实际主动产生的状态比枚举少：它创建 created，持久化 queued，然后直接采用 submitter 返回的状态；retrying 只在命中可重试失败时出现。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22stateDiagram-v2%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B*%5D%20--%3E%20Created%3A%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%20JobRecord%5Cn%20%20%20%20Created%20--%3E%20Queued%3A%20_transition()%20%E5%B9%B6%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%5Cn%20%20%20%20Queued%20--%3E%20Submitted%3A%20submitter%20%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%20submitted%5Cn%20%20%20%20Queued%20--%3E%20Running%3A%20submitter%20%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%20running%5Cn%20%20%20%20Queued%20--%3E%20Succeeded%3A%20%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%20submitter%20%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%5Cn%20%20%20%20Queued%20--%3E%20Failed%3A%20submitter%20%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%20failed%5Cn%20%20%20%20Submitted%20--%3E%20Running%3A%20%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%EF%BC%88%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%9C%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%BD%AE%E8%AF%A2%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20Running%20--%3E%20Succeeded%3A%20%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20Running%20--%3E%20Failed%3A%20%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20Failed%20--%3E%20Retrying%3A%20%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%8F%AF%E9%87%8D%E8%AF%95%E4%B8%94%E6%9C%AA%E8%B6%85%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20Retrying%20--%3E%20Succeeded%3A%20%E6%96%B0%20attempt%20%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%5Cn%20%20%20%20Retrying%20--%3E%20Failed%3A%20%E6%96%B0%20attempt%20%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20Created%20--%3E%20Cancelled%3A%20%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E9%A2%84%E7%95%99%5Cn%20%20%20%20Queued%20--%3E%20Cancelled%3A%20%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E9%A2%84%E7%95%99%5Cn%20%20%20%20Running%20--%3E%20Cancelled%3A%20%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F%E9%A2%84%E7%95%99%5Cn%20%20%20%20Succeeded%20--%3E%20%5B*%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Failed%20--%3E%20%5B*%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Cancelled%20--%3E%20%5B*%5D%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2Fffaa2c9756bd2620b83d80ce27bb640f.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22IJnqz%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uba6676f2\" id=\"uba6676f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u003b0550\" id=\"u003b0550\">虚线意义上的“外部状态同步”和取消在模型中已表达，但当前尚无完整 watcher/cancel API，面试中不能说已经实现。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"bCM1n\" id=\"bCM1n\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa462a04\" id=\"uaa462a04\">4. 提交与重试链路</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sequenceDiagram%5Cn%20%20%20%20autonumber%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Caller%20as%20SparkToolExecutor%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20O%20as%20JobOrchestrator%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20S%20as%20JobStorePort%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20P%20as%20JobSubmitterPort%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20Caller-%3E%3EO%3A%20submit(run_id%2C%20job_type%2C%20payload)%5Cn%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EO%3A%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%20JobRecord(status%3Dcreated)%5Cn%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EO%3A%20_transition(queued)%5Cn%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3ES%3A%20save(record)%5Cn%20%20%20%20S--%3E%3EO%3A%20upsert%20%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%5Cn%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EP%3A%20submit(record)%5Cn%20%20%20%20P--%3E%3EO%3A%20JobAttempt(status%2C%20external_id%2C%20message%2C%20metrics)%5Cn%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EO%3A%20attempts.append(attempt)%5Cn%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EO%3A%20record.status%20%3D%20attempt.status%5Cn%20%20%20%20alt%20status%3Dfailed%20%E4%B8%94%20_can_retry%3Dtrue%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EO%3A%20_transition(retrying)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3ES%3A%20save(record)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EP%3A%20submit(record)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20P--%3E%3EO%3A%20%E6%96%B0%20JobAttempt%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3EO%3A%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%20attempt%20%E5%B9%B6%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%20%20%20%20O-%3E%3ES%3A%20save(final%20record)%5Cn%20%20%20%20O--%3E%3ECaller%3A%20JobRecord%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2F3b9a13e4fd8e63ba99c62daec0af4987.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22blZiR%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"UYchr\" id=\"UYchr\"><span data-lake-id=\"u720bbc65\" id=\"u720bbc65\">重试判断</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud136ef05\" id=\"ud136ef05\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2186c2e1\" id=\"u2186c2e1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud91f6a2c\" id=\"ud91f6a2c\">_can_retry()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1afcff05\" id=\"u1afcff05\"> 同时检查：</span></p><ol list=\"uae47d2f5\"><li fid=\"u8baaaee9\" data-lake-id=\"u59c93bd3\" id=\"u59c93bd3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue60cf6cd\" id=\"ue60cf6cd\">attempt 数量未超过 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ubc9cfd87\" id=\"ubc9cfd87\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f3f16cd\" id=\"u0f3f16cd\">max_retries</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucf3525b5\" id=\"ucf3525b5\">；</span></li><li fid=\"u8baaaee9\" data-lake-id=\"u032c00a9\" id=\"u032c00a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub15db8e8\" id=\"ub15db8e8\">存在 latest attempt；</span></li><li fid=\"u8baaaee9\" data-lake-id=\"u0e0e40f7\" id=\"u0e0e40f7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue178cad4\" id=\"ue178cad4\">message 中包含 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uaf3b5f32\" id=\"uaf3b5f32\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub65f353b\" id=\"ub65f353b\">oom</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1d859b69\" id=\"u1d859b69\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u27831a61\" id=\"u27831a61\"><span data-lake-id=\"u772d4ade\" id=\"u772d4ade\">shuffle</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3bde069b\" id=\"u3bde069b\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u70dfb74e\" id=\"u70dfb74e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u88c7d343\" id=\"u88c7d343\">fetch failed</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9d0e23d4\" id=\"u9d0e23d4\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u787543dc\" id=\"u787543dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2589eee\" id=\"ub2589eee\">timeout</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8cb9a5d4\" id=\"u8cb9a5d4\"> 或 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u3a256a46\" id=\"u3a256a46\"><span data-lake-id=\"u067a7096\" id=\"u067a7096\">transient</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub06fa7db\" id=\"ub06fa7db\">。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u0e976b7f\" id=\"u0e976b7f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f04e0c5\" id=\"u2f04e0c5\">这是可解释的最小实现，但依赖错误字符串，不如结构化错误码稳定，也没有指数退避和 jitter。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"FrztZ\" id=\"FrztZ\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaaaa3dd0\" id=\"uaaaa3dd0\">5. SQLite 持久化</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ufa72e6d5\" id=\"ufa72e6d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u411ade7e\" id=\"u411ade7e\">表结构只有一张 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uab4122ed\" id=\"uab4122ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c67aee9\" id=\"u6c67aee9\">jobs</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubf4bfd48\" id=\"ubf4bfd48\">：</span></p><table data-lake-id=\"KJ52z\" id=\"KJ52z\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"375\"><col width=\"375\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u4a12b726\" id=\"u4a12b726\"><td data-lake-id=\"u06decb97\" id=\"u06decb97\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5fb466a5\" id=\"u5fb466a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubca9809b\" id=\"ubca9809b\">列</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u8ee5d24a\" id=\"u8ee5d24a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4907de2b\" id=\"u4907de2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3bd24662\" id=\"u3bd24662\">含义</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u9bff8557\" id=\"u9bff8557\"><td data-lake-id=\"ua2ba4974\" id=\"ua2ba4974\"><p data-lake-id=\"u547a4f81\" id=\"u547a4f81\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2c3dd023\" id=\"u2c3dd023\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufde77768\" id=\"ufde77768\">job_id</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u9f4eaa84\" id=\"u9f4eaa84\"><p data-lake-id=\"u10a90a3c\" id=\"u10a90a3c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u271fd38c\" id=\"u271fd38c\">主键</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u7b65d5cb\" id=\"u7b65d5cb\"><td data-lake-id=\"u255e2827\" id=\"u255e2827\"><p data-lake-id=\"ud223d48f\" id=\"ud223d48f\"><code data-lake-id=\"u1eb313f3\" id=\"u1eb313f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9a37775\" id=\"ud9a37775\">run_id</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"udfece3b9\" id=\"udfece3b9\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub96c58f2\" id=\"ub96c58f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5434e02\" id=\"ue5434e02\">Agent 运行关联键</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u0baf0750\" id=\"u0baf0750\"><td data-lake-id=\"u8243f278\" id=\"u8243f278\"><p data-lake-id=\"ua42cea3c\" id=\"ua42cea3c\"><code data-lake-id=\"u13c7f6c7\" id=\"u13c7f6c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc745fbeb\" id=\"uc745fbeb\">status</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ufde0ca7b\" id=\"ufde0ca7b\"><p data-lake-id=\"u91ead82b\" id=\"u91ead82b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7403915\" id=\"ua7403915\">便于直接查询的冗余状态</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u4e332944\" id=\"u4e332944\"><td data-lake-id=\"u81ddc3e8\" id=\"u81ddc3e8\"><p data-lake-id=\"u81559bef\" id=\"u81559bef\"><code data-lake-id=\"u36f0f0e3\" id=\"u36f0f0e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0997847\" id=\"ue0997847\">payload_json</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ude164387\" id=\"ude164387\"><p data-lake-id=\"u236f02d9\" id=\"u236f02d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf6f3e9c\" id=\"ubf6f3e9c\">完整 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u718715da\" id=\"u718715da\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52e78d70\" id=\"u52e78d70\">JobRecord.model_dump_json()</span></code></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u97ceedc6\" id=\"u97ceedc6\"><td data-lake-id=\"u058d5274\" id=\"u058d5274\"><p data-lake-id=\"u70c8d50b\" id=\"u70c8d50b\"><code data-lake-id=\"u9f2632ea\" id=\"u9f2632ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"u321b96e9\" id=\"u321b96e9\">updated_at</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ub4973edf\" id=\"ub4973edf\"><p data-lake-id=\"u77444462\" id=\"u77444462\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec424690\" id=\"uec424690\">默认更新时间字段</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id=\"u0d66a0e2\" id=\"u0d66a0e2\"><code data-lake-id=\"u8a5a4c8c\" id=\"u8a5a4c8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18998ea9\" id=\"u18998ea9\">save()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua2c2a7c4\" id=\"ua2c2a7c4\"> 使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u368fa959\" id=\"u368fa959\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e2752bd\" id=\"u2e2752bd\">INSERT ... ON CONFLICT(job_id) DO UPDATE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u042bfbbf\" id=\"u042bfbbf\">。这样同一个 Job 多次状态更新不会新增行。完整领域对象保存在 JSON 中，开发简单，但缺点是很难用 SQL 高效查询 attempt、external_id 和 metrics；生产数据库应把高频查询字段正规化。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1bdfdafa\" id=\"u1bdfdafa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud32fc4dc\" id=\"ud32fc4dc\">注意：当前 upsert 更新语句没有显式更新 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud5a76c44\" id=\"ud5a76c44\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub4cc6d5f\" id=\"ub4cc6d5f\">updated_at</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaf16d9d7\" id=\"uaf16d9d7\">，所以默认值只在首次插入时产生。这是现有实现的一个细节缺口。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"tmNfC\" id=\"tmNfC\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua825bd65\" id=\"ua825bd65\">6. 执行后端选择</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22flowchart%20TD%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%5B%5C%22cli.build_service()%5C%22%5D%20--%3E%20L%7B%5C%22runtime.livy_url%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20L%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%9C%89%5C%22%7C%20Livy%5B%5C%22JobOrchestrator%20%2B%20LivySubmitter%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20L%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%97%A0%5C%22%7C%20Local%5B%5C%22JobOrchestrator%20%2B%20LocalJobSubmitter%5C%22%5D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20Tool%5B%5C%22SparkToolExecutor._spark_job()%5C%22%5D%20--%3E%20DR%7B%5C%22Docker%20runner%20%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20DR%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%94%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E5%8F%AF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%5C%22%7C%20Docker%5B%5C%22DockerSparkRunner%20%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%20spark-submit%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20DR%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E5%90%A6%5C%22%7C%20Host%7B%5C%22PySpark%20%E5%B7%B2%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%94%20Java%20%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Host%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%98%AF%5C%22%7C%20PySpark%5B%5C%22SparkSessionFactory%20%2B%20SparkExecution%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Host%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E5%90%A6%5C%22%7C%20Required%7B%5C%22require_spark%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Required%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%98%AF%5C%22%7C%20Fail%5B%5C%22_failed_spark_job()%20%E5%86%99%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%20artifact%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Required%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E5%90%A6%5C%22%7C%20Planned%5B%5C%22%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%BC%96%E6%8E%92%2F%E8%AE%A1%E5%88%92%E8%AF%AD%E4%B9%89%5C%22%5D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20Docker%20--%3E%20Record%5B%5C%22%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%20metrics%20%2B%20JobRecord%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20PySpark%20--%3E%20Record%5Cn%20%20%20%20Fail%20--%3E%20Artifact%5B%5C%2206_execution_config.json%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Planned%20--%3E%20Artifact%5Cn%20%20%20%20Record%20--%3E%20Artifact%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2Ff020ba55d0ab008058e7b166eaffe362.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22yXH6f%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u18a7243b\" id=\"u18a7243b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u205a467b\" id=\"u205a467b\">这里有两个维度：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u94534c45\" id=\"u94534c45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27903c7d\" id=\"u27903c7d\">JobSubmitterPort</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u985e53f1\" id=\"u985e53f1\"> 管理 Job 领域提交记录；</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub26366af\" id=\"ub26366af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u558631b7\" id=\"u558631b7\">DockerSparkRunner</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6a93a5a7\" id=\"u6a93a5a7\">/</span><code data-lake-id=\"u29abd79e\" id=\"u29abd79e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f2ae515\" id=\"u7f2ae515\">SparkExecution</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9bafebbb\" id=\"u9bafebbb\"> 负责真实计算。当前两者还不是完全统一的异步状态源，生产化时需要以 external_id 为中心收敛。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"uIWxe\" id=\"uIWxe\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc430590\" id=\"ufc430590\">7. 一致性与恢复难点</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"N9Ad7\" id=\"N9Ad7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80d11f35\" id=\"u80d11f35\">幂等性</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u256c49d8\" id=\"u256c49d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u819de5dd\" id=\"u819de5dd\">当前 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uec0526f8\" id=\"uec0526f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f7eb9a6\" id=\"u6f7eb9a6\">job_id</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7a4ed496\" id=\"u7a4ed496\"> 使用随机 UUID 片段，同一请求重复调用会创建两个 Job。需要增加业务幂等键，例如 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5283097e\" id=\"u5283097e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b7b698c\" id=\"u7b7b698c\">tenant + task_type + biz_date + request_hash</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u208c0021\" id=\"u208c0021\">，并在数据库建立唯一约束。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"QA0Ni\" id=\"QA0Ni\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f603d80\" id=\"u0f603d80\">提交与落库双写</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u0a42d699\" id=\"u0a42d699\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11be3501\" id=\"u11be3501\">外部 Spark 提交成功但最终 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua0312f52\" id=\"ua0312f52\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e102f90\" id=\"u3e102f90\">save()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8ddf5f55\" id=\"u8ddf5f55\"> 失败时，可能出现“外部作业在跑、内部无记录”。可采用 transactional outbox：先持久化待提交事件，再由 worker 提交外部系统并回写 external_id。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"eBe6O\" id=\"eBe6O\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62cf6b46\" id=\"u62cf6b46\">多实例并发</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ucd04f96d\" id=\"ucd04f96d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uabd344ad\" id=\"uabd344ad\">SQLite 适合单机，不适合多个 worker 抢任务。生产实现可用 PostgreSQL 的状态 version 做乐观锁，或 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4d94fc2c\" id=\"u4d94fc2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u610c6d50\" id=\"u610c6d50\">FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0e41a5f9\" id=\"u0e41a5f9\"> 抢占 queued Job，确保同一 Job 只有一个执行者。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"lrod3\" id=\"lrod3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c5a754d\" id=\"u5c5a754d\">重启恢复</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6450e96f\" id=\"u6450e96f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub94f0e99\" id=\"ub94f0e99\">启动时扫描 submitted/running/retrying Job，根据 external_id 查询 Spark/Livy 状态。没有 external_id 的中间状态要结合 outbox 判断是否重提，不能直接把所有 running 标成 failed。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"pOGLv\" id=\"pOGLv\"><span data-lake-id=\"uccb1f156\" id=\"uccb1f156\">取消</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uab1fcdb7\" id=\"uab1fcdb7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b57700c\" id=\"u0b57700c\">领域状态已定义 cancelled，但取消必须贯穿 UI、Orchestrator、submitter 和 Spark 后端；还要处理“取消请求与成功回调同时到达”的竞态。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"xnH9D\" id=\"xnH9D\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28fb1eca\" id=\"u28fb1eca\">8. 源码索引</span></h2><ul list=\"u58637852\"><li fid=\"ubbb76810\" data-lake-id=\"u16b44a6e\" id=\"u16b44a6e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u395552fd\" id=\"u395552fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36a3bd27\" id=\"u36a3bd27\">sparkos/domain/job.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9f622909\" id=\"u9f622909\">：状态、JobRecord 和 JobAttempt。</span></li><li fid=\"ubbb76810\" data-lake-id=\"u9f763b7d\" id=\"u9f763b7d\"><code data-lake-id=\"ubde82056\" id=\"ubde82056\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc75a879f\" id=\"uc75a879f\">sparkos/application/job_orchestrator.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u36b59f15\" id=\"u36b59f15\">：状态流转与重试。</span></li><li fid=\"ubbb76810\" data-lake-id=\"u8f405abe\" id=\"u8f405abe\"><code data-lake-id=\"u28ba6f37\" id=\"u28ba6f37\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4e0454a7\" id=\"u4e0454a7\">sparkos/infrastructure/persistence/sqlite_job_store.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub0bede00\" id=\"ub0bede00\">：表结构和 upsert。</span></li><li fid=\"ubbb76810\" data-lake-id=\"u604f9887\" id=\"u604f9887\"><code data-lake-id=\"uab92db8c\" id=\"uab92db8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f06cde7\" id=\"u7f06cde7\">sparkos/infrastructure/spark/docker_runner.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u23f135c0\" id=\"u23f135c0\">：容器执行。</span></li><li fid=\"ubbb76810\" data-lake-id=\"u95644a23\" id=\"u95644a23\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua277ec7d\" id=\"ua277ec7d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30c3d909\" id=\"u30c3d909\">sparkos/infrastructure/spark/livy_submitter.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u92388abd\" id=\"u92388abd\">：远端提交适配器。</span></li><li fid=\"ubbb76810\" data-lake-id=\"u30a619ce\" id=\"u30a619ce\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud063a46a\" id=\"ud063a46a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued0308fe\" id=\"ued0308fe\">sparkos/application/spark_execution.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6f3385f9\" id=\"u6f3385f9\">：计算执行封装。</span></li><li fid=\"ubbb76810\" data-lake-id=\"u8eb626bf\" id=\"u8eb626bf\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub7afb264\" id=\"ub7afb264\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucfb62a0d\" id=\"ucfb62a0d\">tests/test_workbench.py::test_job_orchestrator_persists_history</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u79199f53\" id=\"u79199f53\">：持久化测试。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"D2d44\" id=\"D2d44\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c72fde5\" id=\"u9c72fde5\">9. 如何向面试官概括</span></h2><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ua204f149\" id=\"ua204f149\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5d018b7a\" id=\"u5d018b7a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c4d531b\" id=\"u9c4d531b\">我先定义 Job 和 attempt 的领域模型，再用 Store/Submitter Protocol 隔离 SQLite 与 Livy。Orchestrator 持久化 queued 和最终状态，并对 OOM、Shuffle、超时等失败追加重试 attempt。当前是单机原型，生产化的关键不是换数据库这么简单，而是幂等键、外部提交双写、状态并发控制和重启恢复。</span></p></blockquote>",
  "empty_unpublished": false,
  "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T16:25:13+08:00"
}